---
const title = "Thank You! Download Your 2026 Business Survival Guide | ProfitFlowCX";
const description = "Your business survival guide is ready. Download the report and learn how to future-proof your business for 2026.";
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>{title}</title>
		<meta name="description" content={description} />
		<style>
			* {
				margin: 0;
				padding: 0;
				box-sizing: border-box;
			}
			body {
				font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
				background: #f6f8fb;
				padding: 32px 16px;
				margin: 0;
			}
			.header {
				background: #1a2332;
				padding: 1.5rem 0;
				text-align: center;
				margin: -32px -16px 32px;
			}
			.header img {
				height: 60px;
				width: auto;
			}
			.thank-you-container {
				max-width: 720px;
				margin: 0 auto;
				background: #ffffff;
				border: 1px solid #e6e8ee;
				border-radius: 12px;
				padding: 28px 22px;
				box-sizing: border-box;
			}
			.header-section {
				text-align: center;
				margin-bottom: 18px;
			}
			.main-headline {
				font-size: 34px;
				line-height: 1.2;
				font-weight: 800;
				margin: 0 0 8px 0;
			}
			.sub-headline {
				font-size: 18px;
				line-height: 1.5;
				color: #2b2f36;
				margin: 0;
			}
			.intro-text {
				font-size: 16px;
				line-height: 1.7;
				color: #2b2f36;
				margin: 0 0 18px 0;
			}
			.callout-box {
				border-radius: 12px;
				padding: 18px;
				box-sizing: border-box;
				margin: 0 0 18px 0;
			}
			.callout-box.primary {
				background: #f1f6ff;
				border: 1px solid #d9e6ff;
			}
			.callout-box.secondary {
				background: #fff7e6;
				border: 1px solid #ffe1a6;
			}
			.callout-title {
				font-size: 18px;
				font-weight: 800;
				margin: 0 0 10px 0;
			}
			.callout-text {
				font-size: 15px;
				line-height: 1.7;
				margin: 0 0 14px 0;
			}
			.callout-text:last-child {
				margin-bottom: 0;
			}
			.email-note {
				color: #5a6472;
			}
			.download-button {
				display: inline-block;
				background: #00A8E0;
				color: white;
				padding: 16px 32px;
				text-decoration: none;
				border-radius: 8px;
				font-weight: bold;
				font-size: 16px;
				transition: background 0.3s;
				text-align: center;
			}
			.download-button:hover {
				background: #0088C0;
			}
			.button-container {
				text-align: center;
			}
			ul {
				margin: 10px 0 0 18px;
				padding: 0;
				line-height: 1.7;
			}
			ul li {
				margin-bottom: 6px;
			}
			.section-title {
				font-size: 18px;
				font-weight: 800;
				margin: 0 0 8px 0;
			}
			.closing-section {
				border-top: 1px solid #e6e8ee;
				padding-top: 16px;
				font-size: 15px;
				line-height: 1.7;
				color: #5a6472;
			}
			@media (max-width: 768px) {
				body {
					padding: 16px 8px;
				}
				.header {
					margin: -16px -8px 16px;
				}
				.thank-you-container {
					padding: 20px 16px;
				}
				.main-headline {
					font-size: 28px;
				}
				.sub-headline {
					font-size: 16px;
				}
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<header class="header">
			<a href="/">
				<img src="/profitflow-logo.png" alt="Profitflow Automation Agency" />
			</a>
		</header>

		<div class="thank-you-container">
			<div class="header-section">
				<h1 class="main-headline">
					<strong>🎉 You're In!</strong>
				</h1>
				<p class="sub-headline">
					Your report is ready — download it below.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="intro-text">
				<p>
					First off — <strong>nice move.</strong> Most business owners <em>know</em> something is broken… very few actually take action.
				</p>
				<p style="margin-top: 12px;">
					This report will show you where leads fall through the cracks, how missed calls and slow follow-up kill revenue, and how simple automation can stop the leaks.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="callout-box primary">
				<div class="callout-title">
					<strong>⬇️ Step 1: Download the Report Now</strong>
				</div>
				<div class="callout-text">
					<p>
						Click the button below to download your report immediately.
						<br>
						<span class="email-note">(It's also being emailed to you right now.)</span>
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="button-container">
					<a href="https://storage.googleapis.com/msgsndr/9FeIEoSpZ1czUOgR0jHF/media/6984dedfc9efe402483f9a1a.pdf" class="download-button" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
						<strong>DOWNLOAD THE REPORT</strong>
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="callout-box secondary">
				<div class="callout-title">
					<strong>📩 Step 2: Check Your Email (Important)</strong>
				</div>
				<div class="callout-text">
					<p>
						Heads up: <strong>Gmail loves to "help"</strong> by hiding emails in weird places.
					</p>
					<p style="margin-top: 12px;">
						If you don't see it in 2–3 minutes:
					</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Check <strong>Spam</strong>, <strong>Promotions</strong>, or <strong>Updates</strong></li>
						<li>Search your inbox for <strong>"Business Survival & Growth"</strong> or <strong>ProfitFlowCX</strong></li>
						<li>If you find it, move it to <strong>Primary</strong> so you don't miss what's next</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="intro-text">
				<div class="section-title">
					<strong>🚀 What Happens Next</strong>
				</div>
				<p>Over the next few days, I'll send:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Real examples of businesses leaking money without realizing it</li>
					<li>Simple automations that fix the problem <em>without hiring more staff</em></li>
					<li>How to future-proof your business heading into 2026</li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<div class="closing-section">
				<p>
					<strong>One last thing:</strong> Most businesses don't fail — they slowly bleed.
					<br>
					This is how you stop it.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	<script src="https://widgets.leadconnectorhq.com/loader.js" data-resources-url="https://widgets.leadconnectorhq.com/chat-widget/loader.js" data-widget-id="694aa8a04ca1825eb43abd14"></script>
	</body>
</html>
